 Run;EWC
⍝ Bring up EWC in Multi mode for the Playwright multi-session suite.

 EWC←##.EWC
 EWC.PORT←22323
 EWC.SHOWDEVTOOLS←0

 ⍝ Outside this namespace so it outlives the clones it records, and stays
 ⍝ reachable from all of them.
 :If 0=#.⎕NC'multitestlog'
     'multitestlog'#.⎕NS''
     #.multitestlog.closed←0⍴⊂''
 :EndIf

 'e'EWC.Init'Multi'

 ⎕←'multitest running in Multi mode on port ',⍕EWC.PORT
